{
  "id": "https://geo-carto.github.io/vocabularios/metamorfismo-facies/sin-minerales-metamorficos",
  "type": "Concept",
  "prefLabel": {
    "en": "no metamorphic minerals",
    "es": "sin minerales metamórficos"
  },
  "definition": {
    "en": "Corresponds to non-metamorphosed condition, since metamorphic facies classification is based on mineral assemblages, absence of metamorphic minerals means that the classification does not apply.",
    "es": "Corresponde a condiciones no-metamorfizadas, ya que la clasificación de facies metamórficas está basada en asociaciones minerales, la ausencia de minerales metamórficos significa que la clasificación no se aplica."
  },
